    Bug 2021268 - Calendar Event Read: Close dialog using escape. r=aleca,arschmitz

    **How to test**
    - Set experimental calendar pref in settings to true for read dialog
    - Open an event
    - Hit the escape button
    - Dialog should close

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320180

